  "adaptations": [
    "Native composition follows the concept's three top oscillators, luminous central waveform, right filter and mixer column, compact modulation row and eight-macro footer. It is a functional adaptation, not a pixel-identical bitmap.",
    "The terrain draws real current oscillator preview data as perspective layers. It is not claimed to be a measured spectrum or a complete sweep of different wavetable frames.",
    "The concept's third independent envelope is represented explicitly by LFO 3 ENVELOPE, using that native LFO's attack, decay, sustain and release controls; no third dedicated envelope generator is invented.",
    "Actual oscillator algorithms, retrigger and mute controls replace concept-only synthesis labels and unsupported switches. Algorithm parameter labels and values are dynamically read from the engine.",
    "Eight visible effect algorithm menus are functional; all sixteen effect slots and advanced editors remain available through Full editor.",
    "X/Y morph, fabricated browser patch names and counts, arbitrary signal rewiring and unsupported sample playback are not implied. Native scene modes and filter routing use the actual engine options.",
    "The header is the shared working preset, scene and skin navigation. All eight macro controls keep their real assignable names and current values.",
    "Plot titles identify previews; the original full editor retains the measured output oscilloscope and detailed modulation assignment workflows."
  ]
}
